          "title": "You'll want to know: জেঠা",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "জেঠা — jeṭhā — \"a father's elder brother\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "জেঠা বাবার চেয়ে পাঁচ বছরের বড়। jeṭhā bābār cheye pā̃ch bôchhôrer bôṛo. My father's elder brother is five years older than my father."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "কাকা (taught) is the father's younger brother; জেঠা (jeṭhā) the elder."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "জেঠা (jeṭhā) is listed by CDIAL for Bengali under Sanskrit jyēṣṭhatāta, \"eldest father\" (CDIAL 5289)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
